1
00:00:00,647 --> 00:00:03,607
(Howard:)We're not really gonna go
to the North Pole with him, are we?

2
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:06,236
SHELDON:
I'm still within earshot.

3
00:00:06,695 --> 00:00:09,655
You may wanna wait
for my door to close.

4
00:00:09,823 --> 00:00:10,863
[DOOR CLOSES]

5
00:00:11,075 --> 00:00:14,165
(Howard:)We're not really gonna go
to the North Pole with him, are we?

6
00:00:14,328 --> 00:00:18,248
(Leonard:)Hang on, let's talk about it. This is a
National Science Foundation expedition.

7
00:00:18,415 --> 00:00:20,375
(Leonard:)I don't know
how we can turn it down.

8
00:00:20,542 --> 00:00:24,542
Easy. Instead of saying, "No, we don't
wanna go on an NSF expedition," say:

9
00:00:24,713 --> 00:00:28,343
"No, we don't wanna spend three months
stuck in a cabin in the Arctic Circle...

10
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:30,589
...with an anal nutbag."

11
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:34,560
(Raj:)But if we were part of the team
that confirmed string theory...

12
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:38,063
(Raj:)...we could drink for free in any bar,
in any college town...

13
00:00:38,227 --> 00:00:42,147
(Raj:)...with a university
that has a strong science program.

14
00:00:42,689 --> 00:00:45,399
(Leonard:)Howard, this is big science.
You could be the engineer...

15
00:00:45,567 --> 00:00:48,777
(Leonard:)...who builds the equipment
that puts us on the cover of magazines.

16
00:00:48,946 --> 00:00:57,026
(Howard:)I could also be the engineer who builds
the crossbow that kills Sheldon.

